idk i just think the state is cringe. if you want you can read some of the following works from one russian geographer "Peter Kropotkin":

=> documents/petr-kropotkin-the-conquest-of-bread-1926-edition.pdf The Conquest of Bread
=> documents/petr-kropotkin-fields-factories-and-workshops-or-industry-combined-with-agriculture-and-brain-w.pdf Fields, Factories, and Workshops
